{"seq":2,"slug":"shell-and-cli","title":"Shell 与命令行工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/operating-system/linux-practice/shell-and-cli","wordCount":861,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"shell-与命令行工具\">Shell 与命令行工具</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Shell 是用户与内核之间的命令行接口，理解它的使用要点如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>命令即程序</strong>：Shell 本身只做解析，输入的命令会被替换为对相应程序的调用，因此几乎所有工具都能直接组合。</li>\n<li><strong>一切皆文件描述符</strong>：标准输入（0）、标准输出（1）、标准错误（2）是每个进程默认打开的三个 fd，重定向就是改变它们的指向。</li>\n<li><strong>管道是组合机制</strong>：管道把前一个命令的标准输出接到下一个命令的标准输入，让简单命令串联完成复杂任务。</li>\n<li><strong>文本流是接口</strong>：grep/sed/awk 等工具都以行为单位的文本流为输入输出，这使它们能无缝地相互拼接。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话概括：<strong>Shell 的威力不在于单个命令，而在于它把&quot;命令&quot;和&quot;文件描述符&quot;统一成可自由拼接的接口</strong>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"shell-概述\">Shell 概述</h2><p>Shell 是用户与操作系统内核之间的命令行接口。用户输入命令，Shell 解析并调用相应的程序执行。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Shell</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>bash</td>\n<td>最广泛使用的 Shell（GNU Bourne Again Shell）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>zsh</td>\n<td>功能丰富（Oh My Zsh 生态）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>fish</td>\n<td>用户友好（自动建议、语法高亮）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>sh</td>\n<td>POSIX 标准 Shell</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dash</td>\n<td>轻量级 sh 实现（Debian/Ubuntu 默认 /bin/sh）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 查看当前使用的 Shell&#10;echo $SHELL&#10;&#10;# 查看系统可用的 Shell&#10;cat /etc/shells\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看当前使用的 Shell</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $SHELL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看系统可用的 Shell</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /etc/shells</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"文件和目录操作\">文件和目录操作</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>常用选项</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ls</td>\n<td>列出目录内容</td>\n<td>-la（详细+隐藏）, -lh（人类可读大小）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cd</td>\n<td>切换目录</td>\n<td>-, ~, ..</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cp</td>\n<td>复制</td>\n<td>-r（递归）, -p（保留属性）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>mv</td>\n<td>移动/重命名</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>rm</td>\n<td>删除</td>\n<td>-rf（递归强制）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>mkdir</td>\n<td>创建目录</td>\n<td>-p（递归创建）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>find</td>\n<td>查找文件</td>\n<td>-name, -type, -mtime, -exec</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>chmod</td>\n<td>修改权限</td>\n<td>755, u+x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>chown</td>\n<td>修改所有者</td>\n<td>user:group</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"find-高级用法\">find 高级用法</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 查找 7 天内修改的 .log 文件&#10;find /var/log -name &quot;*.log&quot; -mtime -7&#10;&#10;# 查找大于 100MB 的文件&#10;find / -size +100M -type f&#10;&#10;# 查找并删除空目录&#10;find . -type d -empty -delete\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查找 7 天内修改的 .log 文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">find</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /var/log</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"*.log\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -mtime</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查找大于 100MB 的文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">find</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -size</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> +100M</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查找并删除空目录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">find</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -empty</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -delete</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"文本处理三剑客\">文本处理三剑客</h2><h3 id=\"grep-文本搜索\">grep — 文本搜索</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 递归搜索关键词&#10;grep -rn &quot;error&quot; /var/log/&#10;&#10;# 正则匹配&#10;grep -E &quot;^[0-9]{4}-&quot; access.log&#10;&#10;# 反向匹配&#10;grep -v &quot;DEBUG&quot; app.log\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 递归搜索关键词</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -rn</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /var/log/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 正则匹配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -E</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"^[0-9]{4}-\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> access.log</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 反向匹配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -v</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"DEBUG\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app.log</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>-r</td>\n<td>递归搜索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-n</td>\n<td>显示行号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-i</td>\n<td>忽略大小写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-v</td>\n<td>反向匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-E</td>\n<td>扩展正则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-c</td>\n<td>统计匹配行数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"sed-流编辑器\">sed — 流编辑器</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 替换文本&#10;sed &#39;s/old/new/g&#39; file.txt&#10;&#10;# 原地替换&#10;sed -i &#39;s/old/new/g&#39; file.txt&#10;&#10;# 删除包含 pattern 的行&#10;sed &#39;/pattern/d&#39; file.txt&#10;&#10;# 打印第 10~20 行&#10;sed -n &#39;10,20p&#39; file.txt\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 替换文本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/old/new/g'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 原地替换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/old/new/g'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 删除包含 pattern 的行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '/pattern/d'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 打印第 10~20 行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '10,20p'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"awk-文本分析\">awk — 文本分析</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 打印第 2 列&#10;awk &#39;{print $2}&#39; file.txt&#10;&#10;# 按分隔符切分&#10;awk -F: &#39;{print $1, $3}&#39; /etc/passwd&#10;&#10;# 条件过滤&#10;awk &#39;$3 &gt; 1000 {print $1}&#39; /etc/passwd&#10;&#10;# 统计求和&#10;awk &#39;{sum += $1} END {print sum}&#39; numbers.txt\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 打印第 2 列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{print $2}'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 按分隔符切分</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">awk</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -F:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{print $1, $3}'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /etc/passwd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 条件过滤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '$3 > 1000 {print $1}'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /etc/passwd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 统计求和</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{sum += $1} END {print sum}'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> numbers.txt</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"管道与重定向\">管道与重定向</h2><h3 id=\"管道-pipe\">管道（Pipe）</h3><p>管道将前一个命令的标准输出连接到下一个命令的标准输入。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;命令 A&lt;br/&gt;stdout&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;管道&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;命令 B&lt;br/&gt;stdin&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;命令 C&lt;br/&gt;stdin&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;终端输出&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"命令 A&lt;br/&gt;stdout\"] --&gt; B[\"管道\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"命令 B&lt;br/&gt;stdin\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"命令 C&lt;br/&gt;stdin\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"终端输出\"]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 统计连接数最多的 IP&#10;netstat -an | grep ESTABLISHED | awk &#39;{print $5}&#39; | cut -d: -f1 | sort | uniq -c | sort -rn | head -10\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 统计连接数最多的 IP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">netstat</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -an</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ESTABLISHED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{print $5}'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> cut</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sort</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> uniq</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sort</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -rn</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> head</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -10</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"重定向\">重定向</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>符号</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&gt;</td>\n<td>标准输出覆盖写入文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt;&gt;</td>\n<td>标准输出追加写入文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2&gt;</td>\n<td>标准错误覆盖写入文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2&gt;&amp;1</td>\n<td>标准错误重定向到标准输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&lt;</td>\n<td>从文件读取标准输入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>|</td>\n<td>管道，连接两个命令</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 同时保存标准输出和标准错误&#10;command &gt; output.log 2&gt;&amp;1&#10;&#10;# 丢弃所有输出&#10;command &gt; /dev/null 2&gt;&amp;1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 同时保存标准输出和标准错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">command</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> output.log</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 2>&#x26;1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 丢弃所有输出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">command</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /dev/null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 2>&#x26;1</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"进程管理\">进程管理</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ps aux</td>\n<td>查看所有进程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>top / htop</td>\n<td>实时进程监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kill PID</td>\n<td>发送信号（默认 SIGTERM）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kill -9 PID</td>\n<td>强制终止（SIGKILL）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>nohup</td>\n<td>忽略挂断信号运行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&amp;</td>\n<td>后台运行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>jobs / fg / bg</td>\n<td>作业控制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"网络工具\">网络工具</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>curl</td>\n<td>HTTP 请求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>wget</td>\n<td>文件下载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ss</td>\n<td>Socket 统计（替代 netstat）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ip</td>\n<td>网络配置（替代 ifconfig）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dig / nslookup</td>\n<td>DNS 查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ping</td>\n<td>网络连通性测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>traceroute</td>\n<td>路由追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tcpdump</td>\n<td>网络抓包</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 查看监听端口&#10;ss -tlnp&#10;&#10;# 抓取 HTTP 流量&#10;tcpdump -i eth0 port 80 -w capture.pcap\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看监听端口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ss</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -tlnp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 抓取 HTTP 流量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tcpdump</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> eth0</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> port</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 80</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> capture.pcap</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"shell-脚本基础\">Shell 脚本基础</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"#!/bin/bash&#10;&#10;# 变量&#10;NAME=&quot;Linux&quot;&#10;echo &quot;Hello, $NAME&quot;&#10;&#10;# 条件判断&#10;if [ -f &quot;/etc/passwd&quot; ]; then&#10;    echo &quot;File exists&quot;&#10;fi&#10;&#10;# 循环&#10;for i in {1..5}; do&#10;    echo &quot;Iteration $i&quot;&#10;done&#10;&#10;# 函数&#10;greet() {&#10;    echo &quot;Hello, $1&quot;&#10;}&#10;greet &quot;World&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#!/bin/bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 变量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">NAME</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Linux\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Hello, </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$NAME</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 条件判断</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"/etc/passwd\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ]; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"File exists\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 循环</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">1..5}</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Iteration </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">done</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">greet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Hello, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">greet</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"World\"</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Shell</strong> 是用户与内核之间的命令行接口，bash 是最广泛使用的实现</li>\n<li><strong>grep/sed/awk</strong> 是 Linux 文本处理三剑客，组合使用可以解决大多数文本分析需求</li>\n<li><strong>管道</strong>和<strong>重定向</strong>是 Shell 的核心组合机制，让简单命令串联完成复杂任务</li>\n<li><strong>ss/ip/tcpdump</strong> 等网络工具是网络诊断的基本手段</li>\n<li>掌握 Shell 脚本编写能力是 Linux 系统管理和自动化的基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Shell 与命令行工具","id":"shell-与命令行工具"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Shell 概述","id":"shell-概述"},{"level":2,"text":"文件和目录操作","id":"文件和目录操作"},{"level":3,"text":"find 高级用法","id":"find-高级用法"},{"level":2,"text":"文本处理三剑客","id":"文本处理三剑客"},{"level":3,"text":"